      {
        "id": 17174,
        "title": "Tipos",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145363,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ya hemos visto y usado muchos tipos diferentes de valores. En la jerga de programación, estos diferentes tipos de valores se llaman <strong>tipos</strong>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145364,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Las cadenas son caracteres entre comillas <code>\" \"</code>, como el valor <code>\"PlayerOne\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"42\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"30\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;PlayerOne&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerName);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"PlayerOne\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145365,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Número</strong> es otro tipo que ya hemos usado. Representa valores numéricos como <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145366,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>El tipo <strong>boolean</strong> contiene solo dos valores: los valores especiales <code>true</code> y <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isGameOver = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isGameOver);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145367,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cuando almacenamos <code>false</code> en <code>isPaused</code> decimos que <strong>asignamos</strong> un valor a una variable.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"49\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isPaused);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>isPaused</code> seguido de <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145368,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cómo se llaman los valores como booleanos, cadenas y números?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tipos</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Variables</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir Tipos.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145369,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cómo reconocemos valores de tipo <strong>string</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Por las comillas <code>\" \"</code> que las rodean </item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Por el hecho de que siempre son palabras o letras</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Por las comillas <code>\" \"</code> que las rodean .</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145370,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál valor es de tipo <strong>number</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>100</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"100\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145371,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuáles son los valores <strong>boolean</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code> y <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"True\"</code> y <code>\"False\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>true</code> y <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145372,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué es una asignación de variable?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Almacenar un valor dentro de una variable</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dar un nombre a una variable</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Almacenar un valor dentro de una variable.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145373,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Asigna un <strong>string</strong> a la variable <code>levelName</code>, un <strong>número</strong> a <code>score</code>, y un <strong>boolean</strong> a <code>hasKey</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"null\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"67\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"2800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasKey = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelName, score, hasKey);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"Forest\"</code> seguido de <code>2800</code> y finalmente <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145374,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Guarda un valor de <strong>string</strong> en la variable <code>enemyType</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyType = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyType);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"Slime\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145375,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Guarda un valor <strong>numérico</strong> en la variable.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" livesLeft = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(livesLeft);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>livesLeft</code> seguido de <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145376,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Asigna a <code>isPaused</code> el valor <strong>booleano</strong><code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"21\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isPaused);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145377,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Asigna el valor <code>57</code> a la variable <code>const</code><code>enemyCount</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;fifty-seven&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyCount = \" /><text value=\"57\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyCount);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>const</code> seguido de <code>enemyCount</code> y luego <code>=</code>, <code>57</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17176,
        "title": "Trabajando con tipos",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145379,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>+</code> es el signo de unión o suma. En los juegos, a menudo sumamos números (como el daño) y también unimos cadenas (como el texto de la interfaz de usuario).</p><p>Al unir dos valores, podemos obtener diferentes resultados dependiendo de sus tipos.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145380,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Al unir números con cadenas, el número se transformará automáticamente en una cadena.</p><p>Une los valores y echa un vistazo a la cadena resultante para un mensaje de la interfaz de usuario del juego.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;+&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145381,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Combina una cadena y un número para mostrar la puntuación de un jugador.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;99&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>99</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145382,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sumar un número a una cadena también funciona cuando usamos una variable como <code>score</code> que almacena un número, en lugar de un valor numérico.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"result\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145383,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>También podemos unir strings y booleans.</p><p>Combina una cadena y un booleano para mostrar una bandera de estado del juego. ¿Está el jugador vivo?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"38\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Player alive: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>De nuevo, añadir un booleano a una cadena también funciona cuando usamos una variable como <code>isPaused</code> que almacena un booleano.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;pass&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + isPaused;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>isPaused</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145385,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué signo usamos para sumar o unir dos valores?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>+</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145386,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué tipo es el resultado de unir una cadena con un número?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">cadena</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">número</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir cadena.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145387,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra este código en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10 damage</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10 \"damage\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>10 damage</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145388,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra este código en la consola?<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + level;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(label);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Level 3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>levelLevel</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Level 3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145389,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál es el resultado de unir una cadena y un booleano?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una cadena</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un booleano</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una cadena.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145390,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra este código en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss defeated: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Boss defeated: true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Boss defeated: true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145391,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Suma los valores numéricos para obtener la puntuación final del jugador.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScore = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(finalScore);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145392,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega un valor de cadena al valor numérico y revisa el resultado de la cadena para un HUD de juego.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; coins&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>+</code> seguido de <code>\" coins\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145393,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega un valor numérico a la cadena.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>+</code> seguido de <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 145394,
